          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "My reaction was also \"?\"\n\nAs far as I can tell, it's something related to the optimized, plus storing the expert severity flags as a bit field in the same flags bitmask that holds the \"in error pkt\" in at least (but not all) optimization paths confuses gcc.",
